quest.timber_rights.title = Timber Rights
quest.timber_rights.flavor = I've a Sawmill going spare and I don't hand them to just anybody. Chop timber, cut planks on a hand bench, bring me a share. Then the mill's yours.
quest.first_cut.title = First Cut
quest.first_cut.flavor = You've a mill now. Feed it logs, work it till you've a stack of planks, and bring some back so I can see how you cut.
quest.reading_the_grain.title = Reading the Grain
quest.reading_the_grain.flavor = A log's got more than one cut in it and the mill knows every one. Crouch as you use the block and it'll ask which. Mill me plain planks, then the decorative, then the ornate.
quest.second_bench.title = A Second Bench
quest.second_bench.flavor = One mill's a start. Put a proper load of lumber through yours and bring me the sap it sweats out, and I'll find you another.
quest.deep_in_the_wood.title = Deep in the Wood
quest.deep_in_the_wood.flavor = Old wood holds more than planks. Work enough of it through the mill and something comes out that isn't bark and isn't sap. Bring me a load of that.
quest.a_finer_edge.title = A Finer Edge
quest.a_finer_edge.flavor = You've done the short jobs. Now do a long one. Stand at that mill till your arms know the work, and get your woodcutting up to where I'd call you a sawyer.
quest.standing_order.title = Standing Order
quest.standing_order.flavor = Same order every day: planks and bark, delivered here. Fill it and I'll pay you out of the yard. Miss a day, and it'll still be waiting tomorrow.

